Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: USB 2.0 host on USB-C ports 0 and 2
 (linux-aurora j714s3-9)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-9 carries edimoldovan's T6050 USB 2.0
host PHY and the J714s port 0/2 device tree. From betizzel/omarchy-m5 (9a55b0fb).
